# Baked into `vite build --mode native` (the Capacitor shell). Committed on purpose: the value
# is public by design — it ends up in every shipped bundle either way, and the Worker's origin
# allowlist + session auth are the real controls. Web/CI builds are untouched (they get the URL
# from the GitHub Actions variable; local web dev from .env.local).
VITE_COACH_API_URL=https://alpha-lifts-coach.alpha-lifts.workers.dev
